    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8438" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνεπί-στρεπτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, prop. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without
				turning round</i>: hence metaph., <i>indifferent, heedless,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Herc.</u>
					1251.17
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Artem.
				2.37
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Epict.</u>
					2.9.4
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Par.</u>
				1.45
			</span></i>: also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τεί</span> or 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.90
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τί</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.46e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				418b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Lond.</u>
				121.439
			</span></i>.</div>
